## Active Plan: 002-fix-selection-translate

Read `specs/002-fix-selection-translate/plan.md` for architecture and project structure.

**Tech stack**: WXT + React + TypeScript + Tailwind CSS 4
**Key libraries**: @floating-ui/dom (positioning), @webext-core/messaging, openai stream (SiliconFlow), zod
**Streaming**: Port-based lookupStream with requestId/selectionId filtering; loading until first chunk, then sanitized incremental rich content
**LLM**: 硅基流动 `https://api.siliconflow.cn/v1`，默认模型 `Qwen/Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct`，用户自备 API Key
**UX**: 每次有效新选区显示图标；弹框支持长文本滚动、原文展开收起、发音播放、当前句子释义
**Privacy/Security**: 只发送选中文本和当前句子；模型富文本必须清洗后渲染，样式限定在弹框内
**Out of scope**: 生词本、全页翻译、多语言发音偏好、自定义主题编辑器

**Commands**: `pnpm dev` | `pnpm build` | `pnpm test`
**Docs**: `specs/002-fix-selection-translate/{spec,plan,research,data-model,quickstart}.md`
